{"seq":3,"slug":"webrtc","title":"WebRTC 实时通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/media-and-graphics/webrtc","wordCount":557,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"webrtc-实时通信\">WebRTC 实时通信</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WebRTC 让浏览器之间直接建立<strong>点对点（P2P）</strong> 音视频与数据通道。连接建立需要一个<strong>信令服务器</strong>交换 SDP 与 ICE 候选；<strong>STUN</strong> 帮助双方发现公网地址，直连失败时由 <strong>TURN</strong> 中继数据。<strong>RTCDataChannel</strong> 可传输任意数据并可选可靠/不可靠模式。编解码、回声消除与网络自适应均由 WebRTC 自动处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是-webrtc\">什么是 WebRTC</h2><p><strong>WebRTC（Web Real-Time Communication）</strong> 是浏览器原生支持的实时通信技术，允许浏览器之间直接进行<strong>点对点（P2P）</strong> 的音视频通话和数据传输，无需经过服务器中转。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PeerA[&quot;浏览器 A&quot;]&#10;    PeerB[&quot;浏览器 B&quot;]&#10;    Signal[&quot;信令服务器&quot;]&#10;    STUN[&quot;STUN 服务器&quot;]&#10;    TURN[&quot;TURN 服务器&quot;]&#10;&#10;    PeerA &lt;--&gt;|&quot;信令交换 SDP/ICE&quot;| Signal&#10;    Signal &lt;--&gt;|&quot;信令交换 SDP/ICE&quot;| PeerB&#10;    PeerA &lt;--&gt;|获取公网地址| STUN&#10;    PeerB &lt;--&gt;|获取公网地址| STUN&#10;    PeerA &lt;--&gt;|&quot;媒体/数据 (P2P)&quot;| PeerB&#10;    PeerA &lt;-.-&gt;|备选中继| TURN&#10;    TURN &lt;-.-&gt;|备选中继| PeerB\">flowchart TD\n    PeerA[\"浏览器 A\"]\n    PeerB[\"浏览器 B\"]\n    Signal[\"信令服务器\"]\n    STUN[\"STUN 服务器\"]\n    TURN[\"TURN 服务器\"]\n\n    PeerA &lt;--&gt;|\"信令交换 SDP/ICE\"| Signal\n    Signal &lt;--&gt;|\"信令交换 SDP/ICE\"| PeerB\n    PeerA &lt;--&gt;|获取公网地址| STUN\n    PeerB &lt;--&gt;|获取公网地址| STUN\n    PeerA &lt;--&gt;|\"媒体/数据 (P2P)\"| PeerB\n    PeerA &lt;-.-&gt;|备选中继| TURN\n    TURN &lt;-.-&gt;|备选中继| PeerB</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心-api\">核心 API</h2><p>WebRTC 由三个核心 API 组成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>MediaDevices.getUserMedia()</code></td>\n<td>获取摄像头/麦克风媒体流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RTCPeerConnection</code></td>\n<td>建立 P2P 连接、传输媒体和数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RTCDataChannel</code></td>\n<td>传输任意数据（文本/二进制）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function getMediaStream(): Promise&lt;MediaStream&gt; {&#10;  const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({&#10;    video: {&#10;      width: { ideal: 1280 },&#10;      height: { ideal: 720 },&#10;      frameRate: { ideal: 30 },&#10;    },&#10;    audio: {&#10;      echoCancellation: true,&#10;      noiseSuppression: true,&#10;      sampleRate: 44100,&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return stream;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function getScreenShare(): Promise&lt;MediaStream&gt; {&#10;  return navigator.mediaDevices.getDisplayMedia({&#10;    video: { cursor: &#39;always&#39; } as MediaTrackConstraints,&#10;    audio: false,&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getMediaStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MediaStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stream</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.mediaDevices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUserMedia</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    video: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      width: { ideal: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1280</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      height: { ideal: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">720</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      frameRate: { ideal: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    audio: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      echoCancellation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      noiseSuppression: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      sampleRate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">44100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stream;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getScreenShare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MediaStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.mediaDevices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getDisplayMedia</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    video: { cursor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'always'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MediaTrackConstraints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    audio: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"信令与连接建立\">信令与连接建立</h2><p>WebRTC 需要<strong>信令（Signaling）</strong> 机制来交换连接信息。信令协议不在 WebRTC 规范内，通常使用 WebSocket 实现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as Peer A&#10;    participant S as 信令服务器&#10;    participant B as Peer B&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: createOffer()&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: setLocalDescription(offer)&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;S: 发送 offer SDP&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;B: 转发 offer SDP&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: setRemoteDescription(offer)&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: createAnswer()&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: setLocalDescription(answer)&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;S: 发送 answer SDP&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;A: 转发 answer SDP&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: setRemoteDescription(answer)&#10;    Note over A,B: 交换 ICE candidates&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;S: ICE candidate&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;B: ICE candidate&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;S: ICE candidate&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;A: ICE candidate&#10;    Note over A,B: P2P 连接建立\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as Peer A\n    participant S as 信令服务器\n    participant B as Peer B\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: createOffer()\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: setLocalDescription(offer)\n    A-&gt;&gt;S: 发送 offer SDP\n    S-&gt;&gt;B: 转发 offer SDP\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: setRemoteDescription(offer)\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: createAnswer()\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: setLocalDescription(answer)\n    B-&gt;&gt;S: 发送 answer SDP\n    S-&gt;&gt;A: 转发 answer SDP\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: setRemoteDescription(answer)\n    Note over A,B: 交换 ICE candidates\n    A-&gt;&gt;S: ICE candidate\n    S-&gt;&gt;B: ICE candidate\n    B-&gt;&gt;S: ICE candidate\n    S-&gt;&gt;A: ICE candidate\n    Note over A,B: P2P 连接建立</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class WebRTCPeer {&#10;  private pc: RTCPeerConnection;&#10;  private dataChannel: RTCDataChannel | null = null;&#10;&#10;  constructor(&#10;    private signaling: { send: (msg: unknown) =&gt; void },&#10;    private onRemoteStream: (stream: MediaStream) =&gt; void,&#10;  ) {&#10;    this.pc = new RTCPeerConnection({&#10;      iceServers: [&#10;        { urls: &#39;stun:stun.l.google.com:19302&#39; },&#10;        {&#10;          urls: &#39;turn:turn.example.com:3478&#39;,&#10;          username: &#39;user&#39;,&#10;          credential: &#39;pass&#39;,&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    this.pc.onicecandidate = (event) =&gt; {&#10;      if (event.candidate) {&#10;        this.signaling.send({ type: &#39;ice-candidate&#39;, candidate: event.candidate });&#10;      }&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    this.pc.ontrack = (event) =&gt; {&#10;      this.onRemoteStream(event.streams[0]);&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async createOffer(localStream: MediaStream): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    for (const track of localStream.getTracks()) {&#10;      this.pc.addTrack(track, localStream);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    const offer = await this.pc.createOffer();&#10;    await this.pc.setLocalDescription(offer);&#10;    this.signaling.send({ type: &#39;offer&#39;, sdp: offer });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async handleOffer(offer: RTCSessionDescriptionInit, localStream: MediaStream): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    for (const track of localStream.getTracks()) {&#10;      this.pc.addTrack(track, localStream);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    await this.pc.setRemoteDescription(offer);&#10;    const answer = await this.pc.createAnswer();&#10;    await this.pc.setLocalDescription(answer);&#10;    this.signaling.send({ type: &#39;answer&#39;, sdp: answer });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async handleAnswer(answer: RTCSessionDescriptionInit): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    await this.pc.setRemoteDescription(answer);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async addIceCandidate(candidate: RTCIceCandidateInit): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    await this.pc.addIceCandidate(candidate);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  close(): void {&#10;    this.pc.close();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WebRTCPeer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> pc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RTCPeerConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dataChannel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RTCDataChannel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> signaling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#7