E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ice-stun-turn\">ICE / STUN / TURN</h2><p><strong>ICE（Interactive Connectivity Establishment）</strong> 框架帮助找到两个 peer 之间的最优连接路径。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>STUN</td>\n<td>发现自身公网 IP 和端口</td>\n<td>NAT 穿透</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TURN</td>\n<td>中继媒体数据</td>\n<td>STUN 失败时的备选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ICE</td>\n<td>收集和测试所有可能的连接路径</td>\n<td>自动选择最优路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    ICE[&quot;ICE 候选收集&quot;]&#10;    ICE --&gt; Host[&quot;Host Candidate\\n(本地 IP)&quot;]&#10;    ICE --&gt; Srflx[&quot;Server Reflexive\\n(STUN 发现的公网 IP)&quot;]&#10;    ICE --&gt; Relay[&quot;Relay Candidate\\n(TURN 中继地址)&quot;]&#10;    Host --&gt; Check[&quot;连通性检查&quot;]&#10;    Srflx --&gt; Check&#10;    Relay --&gt; Check&#10;    Check --&gt; Best[&quot;选择最优路径&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    ICE[\"ICE 候选收集\"]\n    ICE --&gt; Host[\"Host Candidate\\n(本地 IP)\"]\n    ICE --&gt; Srflx[\"Server Reflexive\\n(STUN 发现的公网 IP)\"]\n    ICE --&gt; Relay[\"Relay Candidate\\n(TURN 中继地址)\"]\n    Host --&gt; Check[\"连通性检查\"]\n    Srflx --&gt; Check\n    Relay --&gt; Check\n    Check --&gt; Best[\"选择最优路径\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"data-channel\">Data Channel</h2><p><code>RTCDataChannel</code> 支持在 P2P 连接上传输任意数据，类似 WebSocket 但无需服务器中转。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function createDataChannel(pc: RTCPeerConnection): RTCDataChannel {&#10;  const channel = pc.createDataChannel(&#39;messages&#39;, {&#10;    ordered: true,&#10;    maxRetransmits: 3,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  channel.onopen = () =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(&#39;Data channel open&#39;);&#10;    channel.send(JSON.stringify({ type: &#39;hello&#39;, timestamp: Date.now() }));&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  channel.onmessage = (event: MessageEvent) =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(&#39;Received:&#39;, event.data);&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  channel.onclose = () =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(&#39;Data channel closed&#39;);&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return channel;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function receiveDataChannel(pc: RTCPeerConnection): void {&#10;  pc.ondatachannel = (event) =&gt; {&#10;    const channel = event.channel;&#10;    channel.onmessage = (msg: MessageEvent) =&gt; {&#10;      console.log(`[${channel.label}]:`, msg.data);&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createDataChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RTCPeerConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RTCDataChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> channel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createDataChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'messages'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ordered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxRetransmits: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onopen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Data channel open'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    channel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, timestamp: Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onmessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessageEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Received:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onclose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Data channel closed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> receiveDataChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RTCPeerConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ondatachannel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> channel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.channel;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    channel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onmessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessageEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`[${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">label</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}]:`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, msg.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ordered</code></td>\n<td>是否保证消息顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>maxRetransmits</code></td>\n<td>最大重传次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>maxPacketLifeTime</code></td>\n<td>消息最大存活时间（ms）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>negotiated</code></td>\n<td>是否由双方同时创建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Data Channel 基于 SCTP 协议，支持可靠和不可靠两种传输模式。对于游戏等对延迟敏感的场景，可设置 <code>ordered: false, maxRetransmits: 0</code> 实现类似 UDP 的行为。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>WebRTC</strong> 实现浏览器间的 P2P 音视频通话和数据传输</li>\n<li>连接建立需要<strong>信令服务器</strong>交换 SDP 和 ICE 候选信息</li>\n<li><strong>STUN</strong> 服务器帮助发现公网地址，<strong>TURN</strong> 服务器在直连失败时中继数据</li>\n<li><strong>RTCDataChannel</strong> 支持传输任意数据，可配置可靠/不可靠模式</li>\n<li>WebRTC 自动处理编解码、回声消除、网络自适应等复杂功能</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WebRTC 实时通信","id":"webrtc-实时通信"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是 WebRTC","id":"什么是-webrtc"},{"level":2,"text":"核心 API","id":"核心-api"},{"level":2,"text":"信令与连接建立","id":"信令与连接建立"},{"level":2,"text":"ICE / STUN / TURN","id":"ice-stun-turn"},{"level":2,"text":"Data Channel","id":"data-channel"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WebGL 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/media-and-graphics/webgl-basics"},"next":{"title":"Web Audio 音频处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/media-and-graphics/web-audio"}}